{
  "name": "Black Stair L1: The Crossing, Weaponized",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/strike-blade-knife-green-purple.webp",
  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Bulwark + Shadow Courier v1.0 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>A locked door is a suggestion.</em></p><p><strong>Mode: Thief / drift: Toward.</strong></p><p>Your default Package type is either a <strong>Blade</strong> or a <strong>Key</strong>. Declare which you are carrying at the start of each scene; you may switch on a Soma Break.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Blade.</strong> A single opportunistic strike, deployable once. While carrying a Blade, your <strong>first attack from concealment or surprise</strong> in the scene deals an extra <strong>+1d10 kinetic damage</strong> with <strong>(blade)</strong>. The damage explodes on 10s and banks Surge as normal. Using the strike consumes the Blade.</p></li><li><p><strong>Key.</strong> A single-use access bypass. While carrying a Key, you may bypass <strong>one non-magical lock, ward, or password challenge</strong> without rolling, once per scene. Using the Key consumes it.</p></li></ul><p><strong>On delivery</strong> (resolving the Blade strike on its intended target, or using the Key on its intended barrier): — see Class Tier 3 Package Mastery for the Black Stair delivery bonus.</p><p>You may designate a new Package on your next Soma Break or on entering a new scene if your slot is empty.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
